  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/jN7aWTZEtthn6F8xoswCD5ZlqEBm_VjT6zGMTtDIt-A.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{mg} \\sin 45=\\mathrm{f}_{\\mathrm{L}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{mg} \\cos 45=\\mathrm{N} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{f}_{\\mathrm{L}}=\\mu_{\\mathrm{s}} N \\\\\n& \\mu_{\\mathrm{s}}=\\tan 45=1\n\\end{aligned}$\nor\n$\\tan \\theta=\\mu_s$ ( $\\theta$ is angle of repose)\n$\\tan 45=\\mu_{\\mathrm{s}}=1$",
